.TH DRAGONGL-CLIENT 1 "2026-08-24" "DragonGL 2026.05.26.01" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
dragongl-client \- Dragon GL client launcher script
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B dragongl-client
.RI "[\-\-help\ |\ -h ]"
.I backend
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B dragongl-client
is a convenience launcher for the Dragon GL 3D client. It executes
.B build/dragongl_client
from the project root directory with the selected rendering backend, so that
the relative
.I data/
and
.I saves/
directories are resolved correctly.

The backend argument is mandatory: if it is missing, the script prints an
error and exits.
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
.B gl
Start the client with the OpenGL backend (legacy).
.TP
.B vk
Start the client with the Vulkan backend (modern).
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-h , \-\-help
Show a short help message and exit.
.SH EXAMPLES
Start the client with the Vulkan backend:
.PP
.RS
.B dragongl-client vk
.RE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR dragongl_client (1),
.BR dragongl-server (1)
